T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fcf4ceb-3725-4c1f-9928-418faa7d81c4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"むむむ。リングフィットで汗かいた分がどこに行ってるのだろう。","ts":"1624984032.192500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c9dH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac983782-e1a4-402d-8802-9672a91b5332","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"茶碗に盛るご飯の量は間違いなく減らしてる (その分おかずを食べている可能性はある)","ts":"1624982706.191800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KUH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65ced98e-2ae5-422e-b440-344a5319ef8d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むしろ気持ち減らしてるんですけどね (気持ちなので実は減ってない可能性はありそう)","ts":"1624982646.191300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M26I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4333649a-f7a2-4056-8684-3718149c53c2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"逆に増えてるとかでなく？","ts":"1624982451.190600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t8/R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d36e1018-82eb-4065-b2d0-50a88dd9f034","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"リングフィット始める前の食事と変わらない感じです？","ts":"1624982442.190300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9FGT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70eb2685-851e-4494-a91a-6451f9fafd1e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"リングフィット続けてるのに体重が一切減らないの食事のせいな気がしている (食事は特に何も計画的な摂取をしていない)","ts":"1624981888.189800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YG="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b486203-4354-49e6-a7a4-d6c99bab6eae","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ゴリラみたいに植物性の食物だけでタンパク質まかなえる体ください","ts":"1624981805.188600","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1624981820.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3U5c1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"709A25F0-0FB8-43D0-86B8-27CA676B1EDF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"脂は美味いぞ","ts":"1624980600.187900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aJgM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f0b97b7-92a3-471b-bc4b-5898958dc6f8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"お通じがでないと循環が悪くなって腸内環境悪化して、燃焼しにくい体になってしまうらしい","ts":"1624980223.187600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9AfA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19865bf6-4002-4fbe-8c82-9b4557883d8d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"必須脂肪酸とかあるらしく下手に制限すると生命に関わりそうなので過度な制限は怖いと思ってる","ts":"1624980203.187100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QhrbA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8133ea8-9a23-46bf-af6f-eac5caf38e48","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"腸内環境が悪くなるので、良質な脂質を摂取したほうが良いそうです","ts":"1624980174.186100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7rpb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dbb23d3-b0fe-4e27-8e8c-e6023801fb86","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ダイエット中は脂質を控えたほうが良いって思われがちだけど、実際はそんなことなく\nむしろ定期的に脂質をとったほうが良いらしいですね","ts":"1624980141.185400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J=G8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e36faa34-3421-4b67-979b-e3b2021f3974","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いっそサプリ飲んだ方が便利かもしれん。","ts":"1624979823.184500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O=B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71975878-7041-4a08-8ca3-001c79a3d241","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なおバナナは、割とシュウ酸あるので注意","ts":"1624979723.184000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uv6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36b3e51e-be03-4e70-a16c-ced99b3c1813","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"丼物の味付けにも使える便利。かつ丼に使ったりもする。","ts":"1624979627.182900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yyb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"737f38d9-972e-449f-a94e-e592757fb80d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"めんつゆの万能感は凄い。","ts":"1624979402.181900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"honsore","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ub=n8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a75617c-b932-4185-b0eb-aa6d26ddfc80","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"豆腐をレンチンしてめんつゆぶっかけると無限に食える(幻想)","ts":"1624979304.180800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U023FDA0AKC"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U023FDA0AKC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fl9+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcc810ca-6283-478f-9d93-995b51c8559c","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"ちなみにタンパク質の食事誘発性熱産生 (消化吸収過程で発生する熱量) は糖質と脂質の約5倍なので，ダイエットの観点からもタンパク質比率高くするのはおすすめです\n\nソース: \u003chttps://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/dictionary/exercise/ys-030.html\u003e","ts":"1624979297.180600","attachments":[{"fallback":"e-ヘルスネット 情報提供: 食事誘発性熱産生 / DIT","id":1,"title":"食事誘発性熱産生 / DIT","title_link":"https://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/dictionary/exercise/ys-030.html","text":"食事をした後、安静にしていても代謝量が増大すること。","image_url":"https://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/wp-content/themes/mhlw/img/og_img.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"e-ヘルスネット 情報提供","service_icon":"https://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/wp-content/themes/mhlw/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/dictionary/exercise/ys-030.html","original_url":"https://www.e-healthnet.mhlw.go.jp/information/dictionary/exercise/ys-030.html"}],"edited":{"user":"U023FDA0AKC","ts":"1624979406.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFh8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5F64DCAB-0EB7-4D8F-BA71-772F6D507B98","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"お腹が空いたらなるだけ豆腐を食べるようにしてます\nレンチンでなんちゃって湯豆腐にもなる","ts":"1624979281.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U023FDA0AKC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wQlYe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f84aa1f-bf11-4860-bc6f-ea49bc6eecf3","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"煮干しはタンパク質の割合が高いので、おすすめ。","ts":"1624979268.179500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qZyg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9708d4b5-109d-4251-b209-ed659a4992c3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"チーズとバナナは常に家にある。","ts":"1624979246.178300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U023FDA0AKC","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1A9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"225d0c4d-d1d7-4814-b49c-9916c83aabba","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Kiri 好き。","ts":"1624979198.176700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cw_handshake","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7nJgn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a2c64ba-7f55-4d23-9adc-cbfdf5a59312","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"チーズは脂質が多いのがなあ。","ts":"1624979191.176300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ki/v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bf7acc6-1bdc-4779-8197-5d897747b162","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Kiriのクリームチーズなら食べてることある(ベビーチーズほどよくはなさそう)","ts":"1624979127.175400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Odr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f577a78-888f-4323-a2ec-b649d3179923","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"コーヒーと一緒に食べると美味しくて美味しくて","ts":"1624979109.175000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4v2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bcf7c35-c80f-4d7c-8186-5134957bb406","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"いいですね\n私も最近ベビーチーズ良く買って食べてます","ts":"1624979096.174600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rgpi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"033a67a8-ad5d-48a7-8ba0-41398d21c5ed","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ワインのおつまみにしてるというのもある。","ts":"1624979061.174000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8XQQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8365f3e-9d0b-4111-afc1-6b07ce3f19a7","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"面白いですね，たしかに甘味は無限に食えますが肉は有限ですね","ts":"1624979046.173700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KZTz8"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1624979023.172700","files":[{"id":"F026QLEHPFW","created":1624979018,"timestamp":1624979018,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C6TEAZ","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":188351,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F026QLEHPFW/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F026QLEHPFW/download/image.png","original_h":450,"original_w":450,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F026QLEHPFW-f8c5e6c65a/image_64.png","thumb_80":"https:/